:: cuckReactions

/* The watching husband's reaction (setup.cuckReactions, js/cuckReactions.js); Mc fuck sets _cuckHusband */
<<set _cuckReaction = setup.cuckReactions.reaction($tmpGirl, _cuckHusband, $sexAction)>>
<<if _cuckReaction>>
	<<if _cuckReaction.feral>>
		<<sayFeral _cuckHusband>><<= _cuckReaction.text>><</sayFeral>>
	<<else>>
		<<sayNpc _cuckHusband>><<= _cuckReaction.text>><</sayNpc>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
